    "sys_id": "a0000000000000000000000000000001",
    "number": "KB0010001",
    "short_description": "Ledger Gateway posting failure",
    "text": "<h2>Symptoms</h2><p>Journal postings stay in <code>PENDING_GL</code> for 5–10 minutes — the queue depth alert fires.</p><h2>Steps</h2><ol><li>Check the posting queue depth.</li><li>Restart the <code>gl-poster</code> worker if the queue is not draining.</li><li>Confirm the backlog clears within 15 minutes.</li></ol><p>See the attached flow diagram for the full posting path.</p>",
    "meta_description": "Postings stuck in PENDING_GL and how to clear them.",
    "kb_knowledge_base": {
