    "number": "KB0010006",
    "short_description": "Batch Scheduler stuck job",
    "text": "<h2>Diagnose</h2><p>Find jobs stuck for more than 30 minutes:</p><pre><code>SELECT batch_id, status, updated_at\nFROM batch_runs\nWHERE status = 'STUCK' AND updated_at &lt; NOW() - INTERVAL '30 minutes';</code></pre><h2>Fix</h2><p>Restart from the last checkpoint. If postings are affected, follow <a href=\"https://example.service-now.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0010001\">KB0010001</a>.</p>",
    "meta_description": "",
